WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.377
Before submission, inspect the privacy-safe index, sources, version

00:00:04.447 --> 00:00:08.394
history, human decisions, and final files. Include all

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:12.225
six journey results, the functioning bounded artifact, test

00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:16.777
and revision evidence, demonstration, responsible statement, positioning set,

00:00:16.823 --> 00:00:19.923
and execution plan. Correct a missing requirement through

00:00:19.993 --> 00:00:23.481
focused revision. Submit by Sunday of Week Six

00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:26.511
through the established Academy route and retain the

00:00:26.569 --> 00:00:30.621
actual acknowledgment when available. Saving workbook or practice

00:00:30.668 --> 00:00:33.106
notes does not send files or confirm receipt.

00:00:33.802 --> 00:00:37.390
Additional review time is administrative, not another teaching

00:00:37.448 --> 00:00:41.883
week. AI may identify gaps; the authorized Academy

00:00:41.964 --> 00:00:44.518
reviewer decides credentials using the governing rubric.
